{"id": "DcOwUcySo8w", "title": "Video by jackroberts___", "description": "Comment ”SMART“ and I‘ll send you the link to make your Claude smarter.\n\nYou’ve been writing half a prompt.\n\nThe half that says no is missing.\n\nEvery prompt is a wish list.\n\nMore context, more instructions.\n\nBut look at your worst outputs.\n\nYou never asked for any of it.\n\nIt rewrote files you didn‘t mention.\n\nIt guessed instead of asking.\n\nIt built a system for a one-liner.\n\nThat’s not a skill gap.\n\nThat‘s eagerness.\n\nYou can’t fix eagerness by adding.\n\nYou fix it by removing.\n\nOne file. Four boundaries.\n\nWrite less, follow the prompt, check the work.\n\nLike a new hire who never stops to ask.\n\nThe fix was never more training.\n\nSmarter didn‘t mean more here.\n\nIt meant knowing when to stop.\n\nDrop the file in and watch.\n\n#claude #github #ai #prompting #coding", "channel": "jackroberts___", "uploader_id": "66393143335", "uploader": "Jack Roberts", "timestamp": 1788405312, "like_count": 2692, "comment_count": 3399, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1057464737204548a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.511, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.flis9-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMA29lfeemfY5fFZP9oUDWDVHaNcn6_EjiLLEq7cvNyp19QTK3MlOhHu6dsfvbBwdNc-HKd8VM6kZjQzQVrTuNqCqIXHJy5Mt_xQdY.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdrkWP_1eRPZa8kgwaC7BSzRde6uv2Wmv-14WecrKRoQUdFlS7sIn0HKeYVLZzejo1U&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.flis9-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=8-CKy3roTv4Q7kNvwGcYnuN&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=_xb463X_zNrhYm0hjAMUvw&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQI7Rtpnt4cKC4Ps7CE